<section>

<div class="section-heading">

<div class="number">07 / The Operating Protocol</div>

<h2>A high-performance deep-work session.</h2>

</div>

<div class="principles">

<div class="principle">

<div class="principle-number">01</div>

<h3>Specify</h3>

<p>
Choose one meaningful outcome. If the objective cannot be stated clearly,
